# StockCarCommissioner

StockCarAuthority is a deep racing league management simulation where the player serves as the governing authority of a professional stock car racing series.

Build schedules, negotiate television contracts, approve rule changes, manage competition, oversee officials, respond to incidents, grow the fanbase, and guide the league through decades of history.

## Current Version

0.0.1 (Planning)

## Development Status

Week 1 – Project Planning
